## Output

Return JSON only:
```json
{
  "enhanced_prompt": "the full rewritten prompt text",
  "mutations_applied": [
    {"finding_id": "F1", "mutation": "what was changed", "section": "which section"}
  ],
  "mutations_deferred": [
    {"finding_id": "F2", "reason": "Hypothesis-tier — needs user verification"}
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "criterion 1 (testable — e.g., 'persona is grounded in observable behavior, not vibe')",
    "criterion 2",
    "criterion 3"
  ]
}
```
